Spoilers

There exists a certain number of turns you must wait from one prayer to the
next.  I believe (<- disclaimer for would be flames) that for an ordinary 
character, it is 600 turns, for a priest, 300, and about a kajillion for the
Hand of Elbereth.  Observing these limits will prevent "Thou arrogant mortal...
messages.  After that, the response is random, based on your luck, alignment
(stridently, nominally, not Lawful, Chaotic) and relationship to your god, and
current problems.


